# pnpm owns this file's formatting.
#
# Prettier reformatted it on every commit, and pnpm 10 writes YAML in a different
# quote style to the one Prettier prefers, so the two rewrote it past each other:
#
#   f11758f  Dependabot's lockfile   4134 insertions, 7587 deletions   '9.0'
#   72251e6  the next local commit   7557 insertions, 4092 deletions   "9.0"
#
# Two commits an hour apart, near-exact inverses, 11k lines each. Dependabot does
# not run the pre-commit hook, so every one of its lockfile updates flipped the
# file one way and the next local commit flipped it back, burying the real change.
#
# It did not show before pnpm 10, because pnpm 9 happened to quote the way
# Prettier does.
pnpm-lock.yaml
